{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2012-meet-science2-43","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2012,"subject":"statistics","number":43,"points":2,"unitId":"statistics","unitLabel":"기초 생물통계학","topic":"기초 통계학","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["statistics"],"stem":"다음은 어느 대학교에서 한 학기 동안 기초통계학을 수강한 \n학생들의 결석 횟수에 관한 상대도수분포표이다.\n0\n1\n2\n3\n4 이상\n결석 횟수\n0.60\n0.20\n0.10\n0.05\n0.05\n상대도수\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 평균은 중앙값(중위수)보다 크다.\nㄴ. 평균은 최빈값보다 작다.\nㄷ. 중앙값과 최빈값은 같다. ","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t023"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t024"]}],"answer":4,"acceptedAnswers":[4],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":772,"height":104,"region":0,"bbox":[14.7,49.303,308.8,41.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-meet-science2-43/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":181,"region":0,"bbox":[14.7,134.903,310.4,72.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t016","t017","t018","t019"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-meet-science2-43/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":19,"sourceRect":[82.9,153.497,417.0,409.882],"width":334.1,"height":256.385,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.7,49.303,308.8,41.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.7,134.903,310.4,72.4],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"43. 다음은 어느 대학교에서 한 학기 동안 기초통계학을 수강한 ","bbox":[5.0,5.0,323.016,12.276],"spans":[{"text":"43.","bbox":[5